)} cr</button></div>`).join('')}</section></div><aside><section class="section-card"><h2>Bilancio</h2><div class="stat-value" style="color:var(--lime)">${money(game.credits)} <span style="font-size:12px">cr</span></div><div class="progress-track"><div class="progress-fill" style="width:${Math.min(100,game.credits/5)}%"></div></div><div class="muted" style="font-size:10px;line-height:1.6">Budget base sessione: 500 cr<br>Top player: 100+ cr<br>Talenti di categoria: 20–80 cr</div></section><section class="section-card"><h2>Movimenti nel mondo</h2>${game.marketTransfers.slice(0,4).map(t=>`<div class="news-item"><span class="news-emoji">${t.icon}</span><div class="news-copy">${t.text}<small>${t.date}</small></div></div>`).join('')||'<div class="muted" style="font-size:10px">Il mercato si sta scaldando…</div>'}</section></aside></div>`}
